    {
      "v": "dean",
      "t": "Прости, я должен ответить. Да, Аллочка!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So Marina has lost her job, with a sick child to look after and a phone shop as her only offer. Don't worry if some lines went by fast; you'll know them when you watch. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Всего хорошего!",
      "gap": 0.3
